blocks. Pairwise disjointness is retained even when a block happens to be empty. -/
theorem exists_disjoint_bounded_blocks (F : Form) (hF : BoundedComponentSieve F)
    (D n : ℕ) (S : Finset ℕ) :
    ∃ P : Fin n → Finset ℕ,
