      condMutualInfo (Y i) (wordAt w (L i)) (observationHistory Y i)
        (smoothedTimeLaw μ b N) / L i) ≤
      Real.log (Fintype.card K) +
        ∑ i ∈ Finset.range n,
          ((1 + 9 * Real.log T + L i * Real.log (Fintype.card K)) / T ^ 9) / L i := by
